 "description": "<p>Nine modes for the G-spot motor, nine for the clitoral one, and separate controls for each — that split is what makes a wearable worth wearing. Instead of one blended output, you decide which side carries the session, then hand the remote across the room and let someone else make the calls.</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyvibratorrose_2_480x480.jpg?v=1690180282\" alt=\"rose toy vibrator rose\"></p>\n<p>The app route extends the same idea across any distance. Connect over the app and the controls travel to a partner's phone wherever they are, which turns a solo toy into a long-distance one without buying anything else. Between the physical remote and the app, there is no scenario where the controls are stuck on the toy itself.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy vibrator rose\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyvibratorrose_5_480x480.jpg?v=1690180291\"></p>\n<p>IPX6 waterproofing handles shower wear and washing, magnetic USB charging tops it up between sessions, and the dual-motor layout sits flat under clothing — the shape was drawn for wearing, not just holding.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy vibrator rose\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyvibratorrose_6_480x480.jpg?v=1690180294\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Motors: dual, separately controlled</li>\n<li>Modes: 9 G-spot + 9 clitoral</li>\n<li>Control: physical remote plus app for long-distance play</li>\n<li>Charging: USB magnetic</li>\n<li>Waterproof: IPX6</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img alt=\"rose toy vibrator rose\" src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0772/6311/0453/files/rosetoyvibratorrose_4_480x480.jpg?v=1690180288\"></p>\n<p>A wearable that treats who holds the controls as part of the design.</p>\n",
 "short_description": "<p>Wearable dual-motor vibrator with 9 G-spot and 9 clitoral modes, physical remote plus app control for long-distance play; IPX6 body.</p>\n",
